---
functions:
  library-load:
  - code: |-
      mosquitto_ctrl libname x...x
    comment: |-
      To pass validation prior to loading, the name of the library must follow the pattern `mosquitto_ctrl_libname.so`,
      where only `libname` is included as an argument in the command.
      The last argument can be an arbitrary string.
      To make the lib available for the linker you can use `LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$(pwd)`.
    contexts:
      sudo:
      unprivileged:
...
